      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "chopped"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the cataplana vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the pork pieces and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the chopped onion, carrot, and celery, and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the dutch stroop, pork broth, and tomato paste, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 30 minutes.",
    "Season the stew with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Stir in the chopped parsley and serve hot."
